# Era modules

Mirror `scripts/` under `modules/era/lua/`. Guard with `xi.module.isContentEnabled(tag)` and return `{ name = moduleName }` when the later expansion is enabled.

Tags: COP, TOAU, WOTG, ABYSSEA, SOA, ROV, TVR.

Pattern: `require('modules/module_utils')`, `Module:new(...)`, `m:addOverride('xi.path.to.fn', function(...) super() ... end)`.

Cite the patch/date being reverted. See `modules/README.md`.
